    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Position words",
     "texto": [
      "To say «on top of», «next to»… you first put the thing you are referring to, and then the position word with **에**: 책상 **위에** = on top of the desk. It is the reverse of English, and there is no «of».",
      "**고양이가 의자 아래에 있어요** = the cat is under the chair."
