     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "And, also, then",
     "texto": [
      "To join two nouns, you attach **하고** to the first one: 침대**하고** 책상 = the bed and the desk.",
      "**도** (also) can go after 에: 가방 안**에도** 없어요 = it is not inside the bag either.",
      "**그럼** = then. **고마워요** = thanks, more casual than 감사합니다."
